      'jemand_anderes': '<span class="run-choice-opt-t">Someone else</span> <span class="run-choice-opt-d">Guest run: your result and your history stay untouched. The guest result is not saved &mdash; there is a code to take away at the end.</span>',
      'abbrechen': 'Cancel',
      'speichern_nicht_möglich_der': '<b>Saving is not possible:</b> private mode is currently stopping Lucenta from remembering your progress or your result. You can still take the test, but finish it in one go and write down your code.',
      'typtests_wie_mbti_sortieren': 'Type tests like MBTI sort you into one of 16 boxes &mdash; even though research shows personality is continuous, not categorical. Star signs have no demonstrated connection to character traits at all.',
      'die_bigfivedimensionen_extra': 'The Big Five dimensions (extraversion, agreeableness, conscientiousness, emotional stability, openness) have been replicated across cultures in hundreds of studies since the 1980s &mdash; they genuinely predict something about behaviour, relationships and wellbeing.',
