      'test_wiederholen': 'Retake test',
      'dein_porträt': 'Your portrait',
      'gastdurchlauf_dieses_ergebni': '<b>Guest run:</b> this result is not saved on this device and appears in no history. Note or copy the code further down if you want to keep it or open it again elsewhere &mdash; once you leave this page, it is gone.',
      'sehr_gleichförmige_antworten': '<b>Very uniform answers:</b> you chose almost the same value throughout. Some of the 50 statements are deliberately worded in opposite directions &mdash; so a genuine self-assessment almost always produces a more mixed picture. The portrait below is still calculated, but it says more about the answering pattern than about you. A second run, taken unhurried, gives a more reliable result.',
      'lucenta_middot_ergebniskarte': 'Lucenta &middot; Result card',
      'ergebnis_teilen': 'Share result',
      'test_wiederholen_2': 'Retake test',
      'dein_code_mdash': 'Your code: <b class="mono" id="myCode">&mdash;</b>',
      'kopieren': 'Copy',
      'deine_fünf_dimensionen_volle': 'Your five dimensions <span class="n">in detail</span>',
