      'vergleichen': 'Compare',
      'start_2': '← Home',
      'zehn_grundrollen': 'Ten base roles',
      'die_rollen_aus_denen_sich_de': 'The roles your title is built from',
      'anders_als_bei_mbti_gibt_es': 'Unlike MBTI, there are no fixed boxes here. These ten roles are the building blocks &mdash; your actual title always combines one of them with a second, finer trait from another dimension (making <b id="archTotalCount">&mdash;</b> possible combinations in total). But the real result is always the spectrum underneath: five numbers between 0 and 100, not a fixed type.',
